{"text": "Minnesota Senior LinkAge Line\u00ae\n\nMedicare List\n\nO09 \u00a96900 8 \u00a99088\n\nTo enroll, you must contact\nSocial Security at age 65.\n\nKnow your Medicare Part A, B\nand D Initial Enrollment Periods.\n\nEvery year, review your current\nMedicare choices from October 15\u2014\nDecember 7.\n\nUnderstand your Medigap\n(Medicare supplement) six-month\nopen enrollment period.\n\nMedicare does not cover\nlong-term care services.\n\nWhen in the hospital, ask if\nyour stay is observation.\n\nGet informed about Medicare\nPart B and Part D late enrollment\nperiod penalties.\n\nGot gap coverage? Medicare does\nnot cover annual physicals, hearing\nexams, hearing aids, dental care\nor eyeglasses.\n\nIf you have Medicare, you do not\nneed MNsure.\n\nGet help from your Medicare experts\nat the Senior LinkAge Line\u00ae.\nCall 1-800-333-2433 or visit\nMinnesotaHelp.info\u00ae for live chat.",
